*> Reports that are produced only in part: DAILY-REPORT is never
*> terminated, MONTHLY-REPORT never initiated, and the ERROR-LINE
*> group of DAILY-REPORT never generated.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. REPORTS.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
INPUT-OUTPUT SECTION.
FILE-CONTROL.
    SELECT PRINT-FILE ASSIGN TO "PRINT".
DATA DIVISION.
FILE SECTION.
FD  PRINT-FILE
    REPORTS ARE DAILY-REPORT MONTHLY-REPORT.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01  ITEM-CODE           PIC X(8) VALUE "A-100".
REPORT SECTION.
RD  DAILY-REPORT.
01  ITEM-LINE TYPE DETAIL LINE PLUS 1.
    05  COLUMN 1        PIC X(8) SOURCE ITEM-CODE.
01  ERROR-LINE TYPE DE LINE PLUS 1.
    05  COLUMN 1        PIC X(8) VALUE "ERROR".
RD  MONTHLY-REPORT.
01  MONTH-LINE TYPE DETAIL LINE PLUS 1.
    05  COLUMN 1        PIC X(8) SOURCE ITEM-CODE.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    OPEN OUTPUT PRINT-FILE
    INITIATE DAILY-REPORT
    GENERATE ITEM-LINE
    GENERATE MONTH-LINE
    TERMINATE MONTHLY-REPORT
    CLOSE PRINT-FILE
    STOP RUN.
